TheDiscDB (https://github.com/TheDiscDb/web), Apache License 2.0:
algorithm followed, no code copied
  disc/content-hash.ts computes TheDiscDB's ContentHash as
  code/TheDiscDb.Core/DiscHash/HashingExtensions.cs (CalculateHash: MD5 over
  each file size as an int64 little-endian, uppercase hex) does, over the files
  in the order of code/TheDiscDb/GraphQL/Contribute/Mutations/HashDisc.cs
  (OrderBy name). Its MD5 is original code written from RFC 1321. The test
  vectors come from TheDiscDb/data (https://github.com/TheDiscDb/data, MIT).

